{
  "id": "en",
  "name": "English",
  "author": "Hatasoft-Studio",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "source": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "新手区": "Beginner",
    "高级区": "Advanced",
    "高危插件区": "High-Risk Plugins",
    "卸载程序": "Uninstaller",
    "解除占用": "File Unlock",
    "设置": "Settings",
    "特别鸣谢": "Credits",
    "喵～这里是新手区，都是安全的常规设置，放心大胆点开关吧，错了也能一键还原哦！": "Meow~ This is the Beginner area with safe, everyday settings. Feel free to flip the switches — one click restores everything if you change your mind!",
    "注意喵！这里是高级区，操作前会先让你确认风险，慢慢来不要急～": "Careful, meow! This is the Advanced area. You'll be asked to confirm risks before each action. Take your time~",
    "呜哇，这里是很危险的地方！只有外置插件才会出现，操作前一定要看清提示喵。": "Whoa, this is a dangerous place! It only appears when external plugins are installed. Always read the warnings before acting, meow.",
    "在这里集中管理已安装的 Windows 程序，卸载前记得保存好数据喵～": "Manage installed Windows programs here. Remember to save your data before uninstalling, meow~",
    "文件被占用？来这里找到并结束占用进程，或安排开机删除喵～": "File locked? Find and end the process using it here, or schedule deletion on the next startup, meow~",
    "在这里调整外观、日志与小工具的行为喵～": "Adjust appearance, logs, and tool behavior here, meow~",
    "感谢所有让这个小工具变得更好的开源项目喵～": "Thanks to every open-source project that made this little tool better, meow~",
    "系统：{0}": "System: {0}",
    "管理员权限：已提升": "Administrator: elevated",
    "当前为普通权限。涉及系统设置的功能需要管理员权限。": "Running with standard permissions. Features that change system settings require administrator rights.",
    "管理员权限": "Administrator",
    "将以管理员身份重新运行本程序。当前未完成的设置会丢失，是否继续？": "The app will restart as administrator. Any unfinished settings will be lost. Continue?",
    "⚠ 风险提示（必读）": "⚠ Risk Notice (read first)",
    "💖 特别鸣谢": "💖 Credits",
    "📦 卸载程序": "📦 Uninstaller",
    "🔓 解除占用": "🔓 File Unlock",
    "🔴 高危插件区（外置 DLL）": "🔴 High-Risk Plugins (external DLL)",
    "🧩 预装应用卸载（仅白名单可删）": "🧩 Preinstalled Apps (whitelist only)",
    "🧹 软件卸载": "🧹 Software Removal",
    "🟡 高级区": "🟡 Advanced",
    "🟢 新手区": "🟢 Beginner",
    "安排重启删除（选定路径）": "Delete on Restart (selected path)",
    "把当前功能的开启状态导出成预设文件，分享给朋友导入。不包含任何隐私数据。": "Export the current feature states as a preset file to share with friends. No private data is included.",
    "版本规则：主版本号.次版本号.修订号（新增功能+1 次版本，修复+1 修订）": "Versioning: major.minor.patch (new features bump minor, fixes bump patch)",
    "包含会影响系统行为的中等风险设置（如暂停/禁用更新）。进入前需确认风险。": "Contains medium-risk settings that affect system behavior (e.g. pausing/disabling updates). Confirm the risks before entering.",
    "本区域操作可能改变系统更新、服务等行为。请在理解后果后自行决定是否使用。": "Actions here may change system updates, services, and other behavior. Decide whether to proceed after understanding the consequences.",
    "本项目": "This project",
    "不同意": "Decline",
    "残留扫描结果（默认不勾选，确认无误后再清理）": "Residue scan results (unchecked by default; review before cleaning)",
    "仓库：github.com/Hatasoft-Studio/Lets-Meow-Toolbox": "Repo: github.com/Hatasoft-Studio/Lets-Meow-Toolbox",
    "查看待重启删除列表": "View pending-delete list",
    "查看更新日志": "View changelog",
    "查看开源许可协议（GPL-3.0）": "View license (GPL-3.0)",
    "查找并结束占用文件/文件夹的进程，或安排“开机延迟删除”清理顽固文件。结束进程前请保存好数据。": "Find and end processes locking a file/folder, or schedule a delayed delete on startup for stubborn files. Save your data before ending processes.",
    "查找占用进程": "Find locking processes",
    "从卸载注册表读取已安装程序，调用原卸载程序，并扫描文件 / 注册表残留。所有删除都需你手动勾选确认。": "Read installed programs from the uninstall registry, launch their own uninstallers, and scan for file/registry residue. Every deletion requires your manual selection and confirmation.",
    "打开日志目录": "Open log folder",
    "导出报告": "Export report",
    "导出配置预设": "Export preset",
    "导入配置预设": "Import preset",
    "点击「我同意」即表示你接受 GNU General Public License v3.0 的全部条款。": "Clicking “I Agree” means you accept all terms of the GNU General Public License v3.0.",
    "二次元装饰": "Anime decorations",
    "二次元装饰与提示文案": "Anime decorations and messages",
    "访问": "Visit",
    "是": "Yes",
    "请确认": "Please Confirm",
    "提示": "Notice",
    "访问 GitHub 仓库": "Visit GitHub repo",
    "否": "No",
    "感谢以下开源项目与官方技术为本工具箱提供思路与基础。点击「访问」可打开该项目主页。": "Thanks to the open-source projects and official technologies below for inspiring and supporting this toolbox. Click “Visit” to open the project page.",
    "高级区一键还原": "Restore Advanced",
    "更新日志": "Changelog",
    "关闭": "Close",
    "关于": "About",
    "官方底层支持": "Official platform support",
    "还原": "Restore",
    "欢迎使用 Let's Meow! Toolbox。本软件依据 GNU General Public License v3.0（GPL-3.0）开源。请阅读以下协议全文，点击「我同意」后才可以继续使用；若不同意，软件将退出。": "Welcome to Let's Meow! Toolbox. This software is open source under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0). Please read the full license below; click “I Agree” to continue. If you decline, the app will exit.",
    "集成的开源项目": "Integrated open-source projects",
    "将本工具恢复到首次使用的默认状态：还原全部功能设置到系统默认、复位外观选项、清空配置预设。": "Restore this tool to its first-run defaults: reset all feature settings, appearance options, and clear config presets.",
    "结束进程": "End process",
    "解除占用（查找占用进程 / 关闭程序释放占用 / 开机延迟删除）": "File Unlock (find locking process / close app to release / delete on restart)",
    "进程 ": "Process ",
    "列出已安装的 Windows 程序，支持批量卸载、残留扫描与清理报告。所有卸载均需你逐个确认。": "List installed Windows programs with batch uninstall, residue scanning, and cleanup reports. Every uninstall requires your confirmation.",
    "浏览…": "Browse…",
    "配置（预设分享）": "Config (preset sharing)",
    "启用（高危）": "Enable (high risk)",
    "前往 GitHub 仓库": "Go to GitHub repo",
    "清理残留（勾选确认）": "Clean residue (select & confirm)",
    "请将高危插件 DLL 放入程序目录下的 plugins 文件夹后重新进入本区。": "Place the high-risk plugin DLLs in the plugins folder under the program directory, then reopen this area.",
    "请阅读并同意协议后使用": "Read and accept the license to continue",
    "取消": "Cancel",
    "全部为低风险常规设置，直接点开关即可生效；操作都会先让你确认。": "All are low-risk everyday settings; flip the switches to apply. You'll be asked to confirm each action.",
    "确定": "OK",
    "扫描残留": "Scan residue",
    "删除文件提示“正在使用”时，用它找出占用它的程序。系统核心进程会被保护，无法被结束。": "When deleting a file says “in use”, use this to find the program holding it. Core system processes are protected and cannot be ended.",
    "深度扫描（尝试独占打开确认占用）": "Deep scan (try exclusive open to confirm locks)",
    "输入文件 / 文件夹路径…": "Enter a file / folder path…",
    "刷新列表": "Refresh list",
    "外观": "Appearance",
    "外观、日志、一键初始化与关于信息。": "Appearance, logs, one-click reset, and about info.",
    "未检测到高危插件": "No high-risk plugins detected",
    "我同意": "I Agree",
    "我已阅读并理解风险，解锁高级区": "I understand the risks; unlock Advanced",
    "显示底层注册表 / API 路径": "Show underlying registry / API paths",
    "显示可爱的装饰元素与温柔提示。可随时一键关闭。": "Show cute decorations and gentle messages. Can be turned off anytime with one click.",
    "卸载所选": "Uninstall selected",
    "卸载所选（仅白名单）": "Remove selected (whitelist only)",
    "许可协议": "License",
    "一键初始化全部内容": "Reset everything",
    "一键还原全部设置": "Restore all settings",
    "已安装程序（勾选后操作）": "Installed programs (select to act)",
    "以管理员身份重新运行": "Restart as administrator",
    "预装应用卸载（UWP）": "Preinstalled apps (UWP)",
    "在每个功能卡片下显示其对应的注册表键位，方便进阶用户核对。": "Show each feature's registry key beneath its card for advanced users to verify.",
    "这里的高危功能以独立插件 DLL 提供，主程序本体不含任何高危代码。所有操作需管理员权限并二次确认。": "High-risk features are provided as separate plugin DLLs; the main program contains no high-risk code. All actions require administrator rights and double confirmation.",
    "只允许卸载白名单内的预装应用；系统核心 UWP（商店、计算器、照片等）一律禁止，避免破坏系统。": "Only whitelisted preinstalled apps can be removed; core system UWP apps (Store, Calculator, Photos, etc.) are always blocked to avoid breaking Windows.",
    "GitHub 仓库": "GitHub Repo",
    "GPL-3.0 开源许可 · WPF · .NET 8 · HandyControl": "GPL-3.0 open-source license · WPF · .NET 8 · HandyControl",
    "Copyright (C) 2026 Github@Hatasoft-Studio": "Copyright (C) 2026 Github@Hatasoft-Studio",
    "许可协议：GPL-3.0（GNU General Public License v3.0）": "License: GPL-3.0 (GNU General Public License v3.0)",
    "Microsoft RestartManager / MoveFileEx / Registry API —— 解除占用与注册表操作的官方底层接口，本工具仅调用受支持的系统 API，不涉及驱动或未签名组件。": "Microsoft RestartManager / MoveFileEx / Registry API — official low-level interfaces for file unlocking and registry operations. This tool only calls supported system APIs and uses no drivers or unsigned components.",
    "Windows 10 / 11 系统调优工具箱": "Windows 10 / 11 tuning toolbox",
    "Windows 更新设置": "Windows Update settings",
    "语言 / Language": "Language",
    "语言包目录：{0}。切换后界面会立即生效。": "Language pack folder: {0}. Changes apply immediately.",
    "界面语言已切换为：{0}": "Interface language switched to: {0}",
    "版本：v{0}": "Version: v{0}",
    "支持系统：{0}（Win10/11 x64）": "Supported OS: {0} (Win10/11 x64)",
    "技术栈：WPF · .NET 8 · HandyControl（MIT）": "Tech stack: WPF · .NET 8 · HandyControl (MIT)",
    "本工具不含任何加壳/混淆逻辑，高危功能仅以外置插件 DLL 形式提供。": "This tool contains no packing/obfuscation logic; high-risk features are only provided as external plugin DLLs.",
    "确定要一键初始化全部内容吗？": "Reset everything to defaults?",
    "• 全部功能设置将还原到系统默认状态": "• All feature settings return to system defaults",
    "• 外观选项恢复默认（二次元装饰开启）": "• Appearance options reset (anime decorations on)",
    "• 清空全部配置预设": "• All config presets are cleared",
    "此操作不可撤销，确定继续？": "This cannot be undone. Continue?",
