    "系统核心·禁止": "System core · blocked",
    "可卸载": "Removable",
    "白名单外": "Not whitelisted",
    "启用高性能电源计划": "Enable High Performance power plan",
    "关闭索引服务（Windows 搜索）": "Disable indexing service (Windows Search)",
    "关闭自动播放（U盘/光盘）": "Disable AutoPlay (USB/optical media)",
    "用图标代替缩略图（文件预览优化）": "Use icons instead of thumbnails (file preview optimization)",
    "关闭遥测（数据上报）": "Disable telemetry (data reporting)",
    "关闭个性化广告 ID": "Disable personalized advertising ID",
    "关闭锁屏广告与建议": "Disable lock screen ads and suggestions",
    "关闭通知中心的推荐内容": "Disable recommended content in Notification Center",
    "关闭“开始使用”的提示与建议": "Disable “Get started” tips and suggestions",
    "任务栏图标靠左": "Align taskbar icons left",
    "隐藏“任务视图”按钮": "Hide the Task View button",
    "打开“此电脑”而不是“主页”": "Open “This PC” instead of “Home”",
    "导航窗格隐藏 OneDrive 提示": "Hide OneDrive prompt in navigation pane",
    "切换经典 Win10 右键菜单": "Restore classic Win10 context menu",
    "暂停 Windows 更新（超长延期）": "Pause Windows Update (long deferral)",
    "禁用 Windows 更新服务": "Disable Windows Update service",
    "把电源计划切到“高性能”，减少系统降频带来的卡顿。笔记本建议结合电量使用。": "Switch the power plan to High Performance to reduce stutter from CPU throttling. On laptops, consider battery life.",
    "关闭后台文件索引服务（WSearch）。可省下磁盘 IO 与 CPU，但“开始菜单搜索、文件搜索”会变慢。": "Disable the background file indexing service (WSearch). It saves disk I/O and CPU, but Start menu and file searches become slower.",
    "适合磁盘较慢、不常用搜索的机器。": "Best for machines with slow disks that rarely use search.",
    "插入 U 盘、光盘时不再自动弹出播放或执行，防止自动运行的潜在风险。": "USB drives and optical media no longer auto-play or auto-run, preventing autorun risks.",
    "资源管理器不再为每个文件生成缩略图，浏览超大文件夹时更快、更省磁盘 IO。": "File Explorer no longer generates thumbnails for every file, making huge folders faster and saving disk I/O.",
    "代价是文件夹里不再显示图片/视频的预览图。": "The trade-off is no image/video previews in folders.",
    "停止向微软上报诊断与使用数据。离线/注重隐私时建议开启。": "Stop sending diagnostics and usage data to Microsoft. Recommended for offline/privacy-focused setups.",
    "关闭系统用于跨应用推送个性化广告的广告 ID，减少广告定向。": "Disable the advertising ID Windows uses to personalize ads across apps, reducing ad targeting.",
    "关闭锁屏上的“Windows 聚焦”广告位与每日建议内容，锁屏不再推广告。": "Disable Windows Spotlight ads and daily suggestions on the lock screen, so no more ads appear there.",
    "关闭“在通知中心中显示建议”的功能，通知栏不再出现应用推荐。": "Disable “show suggestions in Notification Center”, so app recommendations stop appearing.",
    "关闭系统设置里的“获取使用提示和技巧”等推广内容。": "Disable promotional content such as “Get tips and tricks” in Settings.",
    "Win11 默认任务栏图标居中，把它改回靠左，接近 Win10 的习惯。": "Win11 centers taskbar icons by default. Move them back to the left, closer to the Win10 habit.",
    "任务栏上那个显示所有窗口缩略图的按钮，用不到就藏起来，更清爽。": "Hide the taskbar button that shows previews of all windows if you don't use it, for a cleaner look.",
    "Win11 资源管理器默认打开“主页”。改成默认打开“此电脑”，文件找起来更直接。": "Win11 File Explorer opens Home by default. Change it to open This PC for more direct file access.",
    "资源管理器左侧不再显示 OneDrive 的同步状态提示，界面更干净。": "Stop showing OneDrive sync status in the File Explorer navigation pane for a cleaner interface.",
    "Win11 新右键菜单把“复制/粘贴/重命名”都折叠进了二级菜单，用起来慢半拍。": "The new Win11 context menu folds Copy/Paste/Rename into a submenu, making it slower to use.",
    "开启后恢复 Win10 那种一列到底的完整菜单，操作更顺手。": "Restore the full one-column Win10 context menu for smoother actions.",
    "把 Windows 更新暂停到 2099 年，相当于无限期暂停自动更新。": "Pause Windows Update until 2099, effectively an indefinite pause of automatic updates.",
    "适合不希望系统在关键工作时自动重启更新的场景。安全补丁将不会自动安装。": "Best when you don't want Windows restarting for updates during critical work. Security patches will not install automatically.",
    "把 Windows 更新服务（wuauserv）设为禁用，彻底停止自动更新与后台下载。": "Set the Windows Update service (wuauserv) to disabled, fully stopping automatic updates and background downloads.",
    "这是比较强硬的设置，系统将不再接收任何更新。": "This is a fairly forceful setting; the system will no longer receive any updates.",
    "已启用高性能电源计划": "High Performance power plan enabled",
    "切换失败，可能设备不支持该计划": "Switch failed; the device may not support this plan",
