    "已恢复使用提示": "Usage tips restored",
    "写入失败，请检查权限": "Write failed. Check permissions.",
    "任务栏图标已靠左": "Taskbar icons aligned left",
    "已恢复任务栏居中": "Taskbar centered again",
    "已隐藏任务视图按钮": "Task View button hidden",
    "已恢复显示": "Visibility restored",
    "已默认打开“此电脑”": "“This PC” now opens by default",
    "已恢复默认“主页”": "Default “Home” restored",
    "已隐藏 OneDrive 同步提示": "OneDrive sync prompt hidden",
    "已暂停更新至 2099 年": "Updates paused until 2099",
    "写入失败，请以管理员身份运行": "Write failed. Run as administrator.",
    "已恢复自动更新": "Automatic updates restored",
    "已禁用 Windows 更新服务（重启后彻底生效）": "Windows Update service disabled (fully effective after restart)",
