    "高危系统组件管理插件": "High-Risk System Component Manager Plugin",
    "集中管理高风险系统设置（杀毒、防火墙、系统浏览器组件）。": "Manage high-risk system settings (antivirus, firewall, system browser components) in one place.",
    "所有操作必须由你在界面手动确认，且需要管理员权限，任何情况下都不会自动执行。": "Every action must be manually confirmed in the UI and requires administrator rights; nothing ever runs automatically.",
    "实现思路参考开源项目：Win11Debloat (https://github.com/Raphire/Win11Debloat) 与 ": "Approach inspired by open-source projects: Win11Debloat (https://github.com/Raphire/Win11Debloat) and ",
    "Sophia Script (https://github.com/farag2/Sophia-Script) 的注册表策略方案；": "Sophia Script (https://github.com/farag2/Sophia-Script) registry policies;",
    "本插件为独立实现，仅借鉴其公开的注册表键位口径。": "This plugin is an independent implementation that only references their public registry key conventions.",
    "关闭 Windows Defender": "Disable Windows Defender",
    "关闭 Windows 防火墙": "Disable Windows Firewall",
    "移除 Edge / WebView2 系统组件": "Remove Edge / WebView2 system components",
    "停用 Windows 安全中心（Defender）的实时防护与病毒扫描。": "Disable real-time protection and virus scanning in Windows Security (Defender).",
    "适合安装了第三方杀毒、或在内网/离线环境统一管理的场景。关闭后系统将缺少微软原生防护。": "For setups with third-party antivirus or centrally managed intranet/offline environments. After disabling, the system loses Microsoft's built-in protection.",
    "⚠ 高危操作：关闭后将不再有 Windows 自带病毒防护，系统安全风险显著上升！": "⚠ HIGH RISK: Disabling removes Windows' built-in virus protection and significantly raises security risk!",
    "• Windows 11 必须先在“Windows 安全中心 → 病毒和威胁防护 → 管理设置”里手动关闭“篡改防护”，否则本操作不会生效。": "• On Windows 11 you must first manually turn off “Tamper Protection” in Windows Security → Virus & threat protection → Manage settings, or this action has no effect.",
    "• 建议仅在已安装可靠第三方安全软件，或明确知晓后果时启用。": "• Only enable this if you have reliable third-party security software or fully understand the consequences.",
    "• 本操作不会删除任何文件，仅修改系统策略，可通过“还原”恢复。": "• This action deletes no files; it only changes system policies and can be reverted with “Restore”.",
    "立即关闭专用、域、公用三个网络配置文件的 Windows 防火墙，并通过策略保持该状态。": "Immediately disable Windows Firewall for the Private, Domain, and Public profiles, and keep it disabled via policy.",
    "适合已部署硬件/软件防火墙，或需要在局域网内完全开放端口的场景。": "For environments with hardware/software firewalls already deployed, or where all ports must be open on the LAN.",
    "⚠ 高危操作：关闭后本机不再拦截入站网络连接，公网/局域网直接暴露！": "⚠ HIGH RISK: After disabling, this PC no longer blocks inbound connections and is directly exposed to the internet/LAN!",
    "• 请确认你已有其他层级的防火墙（如路由器 ACL、硬件防火墙）。": "• Make sure you have another layer of firewall protection (e.g. router ACLs or a hardware firewall).",
    "• 仅限有明确需要的场景，可通过“还原”一键恢复。": "• Only for cases where it is clearly needed; “Restore” brings it back with one click.",
    "调用 Microsoft Edge 官方卸载器，以强制模式移除浏览器（不含 WebView2 运行时，以免影响其它程序）。": "Call Microsoft Edge's official uninstaller to force-remove the browser (excluding the WebView2 runtime so other programs are unaffected).",
    "适合不希望使用 Edge、改用其他浏览器的场景。新版 Windows 11 可能将其作为受保护组件拒绝卸载。": "For users who prefer another browser. Newer Windows 11 versions may treat Edge as a protected component and refuse removal.",
    "⚠ 高危操作：将尝试移除系统级 Edge 浏览器！": "⚠ HIGH RISK: This will attempt to remove the system-level Edge browser!",
    "• 新版 Windows 11 可能通过官方卸载器拒绝移除，属系统限制。": "• Newer Windows 11 may refuse removal through the official uninstaller; this is a system limitation.",
    "• 操作只调用官方卸载器，不直接删除系统文件；如需恢复请重新安装 Edge。": "• This only calls the official uninstaller and does not delete system files directly; reinstall Edge to restore it.",
    "• 若操作后 Edge 仍存在，说明系统当前版本不允许卸载，请改用“设置→应用”手动尝试。": "• If Edge remains after the action, the current Windows version does not allow removal; try manually via Settings → Apps.",
    "HandyControl": "HandyControl",
    "Open-Shell（经典开始菜单 / 右键菜单思路）": "Open-Shell (classic Start menu / context menu approach)",
    "本工具箱的整套现代化卡片 UI 与控件（Card、Dialog、Growl、主题切换）基于 HandyControl 构建。": "The modern card UI and controls (Card, Dialog, Growl, theme switching) are built on HandyControl.",
    "本工具“切换经典 Win10 右键菜单”功能参考了 Open-Shell 社区对 Win11 右键菜单回归的注册表思路。": "The “restore classic Win10 context menu” feature references the Open-Shell community's registry approach to bringing back the Win11 context menu.",
    "本工具“软件卸载 / 残留扫描”模块的设计思路参考 BCU 的卸载注册表读取与残留检测方案，为独立实现。": "The Software Uninstall / Residue Scan module was inspired by BCU's uninstall-registry reading and residue detection, as an independent implementation.",
    "本工具预装 UWP 卸载白名单与“关闭广告/遥测/通知推荐”的注册表键位口径参考了 Win11Debloat 的公开清单。": "The preinstalled UWP removal whitelist and registry keys for “disable ads/telemetry/notification recommendations” reference Win11Debloat's public list.",
    "本工具部分系统设置（暂停更新、服务管理）的注册表 / sc 命令口径参考了 Sophia Script 的公开脚本。": "Some system settings (pausing updates, service management) reference Sophia Script's public scripts for registry / sc commands.",
    "EZ-Mirror为此项目提供了Github仓库加速下载服务，提升用户体验。": "EZ-Mirror provides accelerated GitHub repository downloads for this project to improve the user experience.",
    "【新增】多语言支持：新增外置语言包机制（.meowlang，内容为 JSON 文本），启动时自动扫描程序目录下的 lang 文件夹。": "[NEW] Multi-language support: external language packs (.meowlang, JSON text) are scanned automatically from the app's lang folder at startup.",
    "【新增】设置页新增语言选择：检测到语言包后即可即时切换界面语言，无需重启程序。": "[NEW] Language selector in Settings: switch the UI language instantly when language packs are detected, with no restart.",
    "【新增】简体中文作为源语言直接内嵌于程序本体，无需安装语言包即可使用。": "[NEW] Simplified Chinese is embedded as the source language, usable without installing any language pack.",
    "【新增】官方语言包：繁体中文、日语、英语，随程序发布在 lang 文件夹内。": "[NEW] Official language packs: Traditional Chinese, Japanese, and English, shipped in the lang folder.",
    "【新增】所有页面加入网页风格的右侧滚动条：内容超出窗口时自动出现，可上下拖动滑块、点击轨道翻页，滑块悬停/拖动时变粉色，圆角 Win11 样式。": "[NEW] Web-style right-hand scrollbars on all pages: appear when content exceeds the window, support thumb dragging and track-click paging, turn pink on hover/drag, with rounded Win11 styling.",
    "【修复】解除占用页占用进程列表在小窗口下高度塌陷、滚轮被内部列表吞掉的问题，现在可随整页正常滚动。": "[FIX] Fixed the locking-process list collapsing in small windows on the File Unlock page and the mouse wheel being swallowed by the inner list; it now scrolls with the page.",
    "【修复】日志系统：日志改为全局记录，记录用户全部设置操作、执行结果与时间（INFO/WARN/ERROR），不再为空文件。": "[FIX] Logging: logs are now global and record all user setting actions, results, and timestamps (INFO/WARN/ERROR) instead of being empty files.",
    "【新增】设置页新增「一键初始化全部内容」：还原全部功能设置到默认状态、复位外观设置、清空配置预设。": "[NEW] Settings now has “Reset Everything”: restore all feature settings to defaults, reset appearance, and clear config presets.",
    "【新增】版本号体系：自此版起为 v0.1.1，关于页显示当前版本；新增「查看更新日志」按钮（本窗口）。": "[NEW] Versioning system: starting at v0.1.1, the About page shows the current version, and a “View Changelog” button opens this window.",
    "【新增】特别鸣谢：每个开源项目新增「访问」按钮，一键打开该项目主页/GitHub 仓库；新增 EZ-Mirror 条目；修复字体模糊（加大字号、加深颜色）。": "[NEW] Credits: each project now has a “Visit” button to open its homepage/GitHub repo in one click; added EZ-Mirror; fixed blurry fonts (larger size, darker color).",
    "【新增】界面重组：「卸载程序」与「解除占用」从新手区/高级区拆出，各自独立为一个导航分类与独立页面。": "[NEW] UI reorganization: Uninstaller and File Unlock were moved out of Beginner/Advanced into their own navigation categories and pages.",
    "【新增】关于页新增 GitHub 仓库信息与「前往 GitHub 仓库」一键按钮。": "[NEW] About page now shows GitHub repository info and a one-click “Go to GitHub repo” button.",
    "【修复】二次元模式下开关与按钮的颜色、文字可读性优化。": "[FIX] Improved switch and button colors and text readability in anime mode.",
    "感谢您对本项目的支持！如果出现了任何问题或Bug，请前往本项目的官方Github仓库提Issue！": "Thank you for supporting this project! If you encounter any problems or bugs, please open an Issue in the official GitHub repository!",
    "官方Github仓库：https://github.com/Hatasoft-Studio/Lets-Meow-Toolbox": "Official GitHub repository: https://github.com/Hatasoft-Studio/Lets-Meow-Toolbox",
    "LetsMeowToolbox 高危插件（Defender / 防火墙 / Edge）": "LetsMeowToolbox High-Risk Plugin (Defender / Firewall / Edge)",
    "集中管理高风险系统设置（杀毒、防火墙、系统浏览器组件）。所有操作必须由你在界面手动确认，且需要管理员权限，任何情况下都不会自动执行。": "Manage high-risk system settings (antivirus, firewall, system browser components) in one place. Every action must be manually confirmed in the UI and requires administrator rights; nothing ever runs automatically.",
    "实现思路参考开源项目：Win11Debloat (https://github.com/Raphire/Win11Debloat) 与 Sophia Script (https://github.com/farag2/Sophia-Script) 的注册表策略方案；本插件为独立实现，仅借鉴其公开的注册表键位口径。": "Approach inspired by open-source projects Win11Debloat (https://github.com/Raphire/Win11Debloat) and Sophia Script (https://github.com/farag2/Sophia-Script) registry policies. This plugin is an independent implementation that only references their public registry key conventions.",
