    "无法安装语言包：已安装的同名语言包与待安装语言包的作者或作者网站不一致。\n\n请手动删除旧语言包后重试。\n\n旧语言包：{0}（{1}）": "Cannot install the language pack: the installed pack with the same ID has a different author or author website.\n\nPlease delete the old language pack manually and try again.\n\nInstalled pack: {0} ({1})",
